{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"xianzhu-e-o002a","title":"刘备少时与母贩履织席","accounts":[{"id":"xianzhu-e-o002a-account","label":"《先主传》正文","text":"刘备少时丧父，与母亲以贩履织席为业。","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o002a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"liu-bei","role":"贩履织席","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o002a-q"]},{"person":"xianzhu-p0006","role":"贩履织席","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o002a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"刘备少时","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o002a-q"]},"source_order":[32,3,"O002a"],"order":6492},{"id":"xianzhu-e-o003a","title":"刘备十五岁从卢植学","accounts":[{"id":"xianzhu-e-o003a-account","label":"《先主传》正文","text":"母亲使十五岁的刘备外出求学，刘备与刘德然、公孙瓒同师卢植。","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o003a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"liu-bei","role":"求学","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o003a-q"]},{"person":"xianzhu-p0006","role":"使子行学","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o003a-q"]},{"person":"xianzhu-p0008","role":"同学","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o003a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0093","role":"同学","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o003a-q"]},{"person":"xianzhu-p0009","role":"授学","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o003a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"刘备十五岁","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o003a-q"]},"source_order":[32,4,"O003a"],"order":6494}],"persons":[{"id":"xianzhu-p0006","name":"刘备母","evidence":["xianzhu-q-o002"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"xianzhu-m-o002-xianzhu-p0006","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["xianzhu-q-o002"]},{"id":"xianzhu-m-o003-xianzhu-p0006","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["xianzhu-q-o003"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"xianzhu-e-o002a-q","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-aa1599a2aaa9082c12d1","layer":"original","quote":"先主少孤，与母贩履织席为业。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":2,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":14,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xianzhu-e-o003a-q","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-7e98ab0f04859dab4e1e","layer":"original","quote":"年十五，母使行学〖8〗；与同宗刘德然、辽西公孙瓒，俱事故九江太守同郡卢植。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":3,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":37,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xianzhu-q-o002","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-aa1599a2aaa9082c12d1","layer":"original","quote":"先主少孤，与母贩履织席为业。舍东南角篱上，有桑树生高五丈余，遥望见童童如小车盖〖6〗。往来者皆怪此树非凡，或谓“当出贵人”。﹝二﹞先主少时，与宗中诸小儿于树下戏。言：“吾必当乘此羽葆盖车〖7〗。”叔父子敬谓曰：“汝勿妄语，灭吾门也！”","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":2,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":117,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xianzhu-q-o003","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-7e98ab0f04859dab4e1e","layer":"original","quote":"年十五，母使行学〖8〗；与同宗刘德然、辽西公孙瓒，俱事故九江太守同郡卢植。德然父元起常资给先主，与德然等〖9〗。元起妻曰：“各自一家，何能常尔邪〖10〗！” 〔元〕 起曰：“吾宗中有此儿，非常人也。”而瓒深与先主相友；瓒年长，先主以兄事之。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":3,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":120,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
